p>HOW DO I PUT IT ON?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAKe2i5zFJ_childItem_1","label":"ggAKe2i5zFJ_childItem_1","default":"<p>SHIPPING INFORMATION</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAKe2i5zFJ_childItem_2","label":"ggAKe2i5zFJ_childItem_2","default":"<p>WHAT CAN IT HELP ME WITH?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAKe2i5zFJ_childItem_3","label":"ggAKe2i5zFJ_childItem_3","default":"<p>PRODUCT INFORMATION</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAKe2i5zFJ_childItem_4","label":"ggAKe2i5zFJ_childItem_4","default":"<p>IMPORTANT DISCLAIMER</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEszmYBtjW_text","label":"ggEszmYBtjW_text","default":"<p>To wear your Gudslip® Blind Fold correctly, simply place it over your eyes, ensuring it covers them completely to block out light. Then, adjust the strap at the back for a snug but comfortable fit, making sure it’s not too tight. Secure the strap once you’ve achieved the perfect fit. Feel around the edges to make sure there are no gaps where light can get through, adjusting as needed. With these easy steps, you’ll create an ideal dark environment for a restful night’s sleep.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8sQY92ePf_text","label":"gg8sQY92ePf_text","default":"<p>- FREE Shipping on orders +49€<br>&nbsp;</p><p>- Spain and Portugal orders 1-3 working days</p><p>- Rest of Europe orders 3-5 working days approximately.</p><p>- Latin America orders 10-15 working days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shipment tracking ID will be provided after your product(s) is dispatched.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKDmNmzdy6_text","label":"ggKDmNmzdy6_text","default":"<p><strong>Blocks Out Light: </strong>Effectively blocks out all external light, helping to prevent sleep disruptions and early morning wakefulness caused by light.</p><p><br><strong>Reduces Eye Strain: </strong>Soft material reduces pressure and strain on your eyes, providing comfort during sleep, which is especially beneficial after a long day of screen use.</p><p><br><strong>Enhances Sleep Quality: </strong>Creates a pitch-dark environment that promotes deeper, more restorative sleep by regulating your natural sleep cycle.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzCaBZ4IcF_text","label":"ggzCaBZ4IcF_text","default":"<p><strong>Material Comfort:</strong> Crafted from ultra-soft, breathable fabric that rests gently against the skin, ensuring comfort without irritation.</p><p><br><strong>Effective Light Blocking: </strong>Ensures complete darkness, optimizing your body’s natural sleep cycle and boosting melatonin production.</p><p><br><strong>Adjustable Strap:</strong> Features a customizable fit with an adjustable strap, suitable for any head size, and remains securely in place all night.</p><p><br><strong>Travel Friendly: </strong>Lightweight and compact, making it an essential accessory for improving sleep on planes, in hotels, or during any travel.</p><p><br><strong>Durable:</strong> Built to last, the Gudslip® Blind Fold withstands frequent use, maintaining its shape and effectiveness over time.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxagPhb-A7_text","label":"ggxagPhb-A7_text","default":"<p>While Gudslip® Tape is generally safe. Do not use Gudslip® Tape if you have trouble breathing through your nose. Do not use by itself without a CPAP if you are obese (BMI over 35), Do not use if you have very low blood pressure. Do not use if you have severe heart or breathing problems, or if you have a cold, sinus, or ear infection. Do not use if you have severely chapped lips or non-intact skin immediately around the mouth, or after consuming alcohol or sedatives.</p>"}],
